      "Title": "Exam ACD101 topic 1 question 1 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A customer wants to display a small toolbar with three icons - a \"sad face,\" a \"face with neutral expression,\" and a \"happy face\" - on the bottom of every page in their application."
